WEBVTT

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:08.610
<b>Meiji Tokyo Renka</b>

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:38.980
You still insist on this, Saotome?

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:49.800
Don't tell me you've been 
possessed by a ghost!

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:47.020
<b>Meiji Tokyo Renka</b>

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:52.340
One, two, three. One, two, three.

00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:55.820
One, two, three... One, two, three.

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:58.290
That's it, you're doing well.

00:02:58.290 --> 00:02:59.830
Just what I'd expect from 
my Little Squirrel.

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:02.060
Y-You think so?

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:04.590
I am looking forward to the day when I can

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:07.820
show off my beautiful fiancée
in a dress to the world.

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:09.340
A-A dress?!

00:03:10.070 --> 00:03:11.830
Whoops.

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:13.700
Are you all right?

00:03:14.430 --> 00:03:16.430
Y-Yes.

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:21.650
I'm going to go look for the black cat.

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:24.540
But it's still bright outside.

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:27.580
It's better than staying 
here and doing nothing.

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:30.900
I just want to find some place 
where cats like to gather.

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:34.990
I'll go with him, too.

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:39.460
Syunso-san! Please wait for me!

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:52.750
<b>Masagocho Cat Café Incident</b>

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:57.000
Please wait, Syunso-san!

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:58.740
Why did you come?

00:03:58.740 --> 00:03:59.540
Huh?

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:03.640
Wouldn't you rather be practicing 
your dancing with Ougai-san?

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:07.400
But searching for the black 
cat is more important.

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:12.010
Ougai-san has ordered an 
expensive dress for you,

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:14.880
yet you intend to make a fool of him?

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:18.410
T-That's not my intention...

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:23.400
Are you mad about something, Syunso-san?

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:28.340
Not particularly.

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:30.610
Oh my fairy!

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:32.780
To be running into you like this,

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:38.630
you and I are truly tied together 
by the red wire of fate!

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:41.240
G-Good day, Yakumo-san.

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:42.160
Hello.

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:44.670
Are you both going somewhere today?

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:47.850
Y-Yes. We thought we would look for somewhere

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:50.170
cats gather, to try to find the black cat.

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:51.980
Is that so?

00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:56.030
Well then, the café I am heading 
to now happens to be one such place.

00:04:56.030 --> 00:04:57.550
Would you like to accompany me?

00:04:57.550 --> 00:05:00.200
May we? Syunso-san!

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:02.460
Sure, I don't see why not.

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:04.950
Okay! We must strike while the iron is hot!

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:07.960
Now then, let's go.

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:12.320
I had no idea there was a café in this area.

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:14.780
You could say it's a secret retreat.

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:17.070
It's my special spot.

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:20.810
Are you sure it's all right 
for us to go there, too?

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:23.150
It will be no problem at all.

00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:26.010
I am very much in your debt, after all.

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:28.840
I will treat you to some delicious tea.

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:31.230
I'm just worried.

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:33.100
That voice belongs to...

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:35.490
Worried? Listen to me...

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:38.430
I was wondering why you were
gone for hours on end.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:40.900
To find you pacing around the mailbox 
like a puppy

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:42.610
is kind of pathetic, don't you think?

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:46.730
But what if the envelope with 
your manuscript in it were to be torn?

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:48.800
It's not going to be.

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:51.510
Your tendency to worry is 
a real pain sometimes.

00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:53.850
Good day, Kyoka-san.

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:55.260
I-It's you.

00:05:57.110 --> 00:05:58.630
Who is this girl?

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:02.660
One of my readers?

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:04.870
S-Sensei, she is—

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:06.120
Sensei?

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:10.120
Come on, now, you can't possibly be saying 
that you aren't familiar with the name

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:13.130
Ozaki Koyo, the most famous 
popular writer in Asia?

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:15.630
Ozaki Koyo-san is...

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:19.730
Oh! You wrote <i>The Golden Demon</i>!

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:22.260
I saw the play of it recently!

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:24.790
Really? Then do tell me your thoughts on it.

00:06:24.790 --> 00:06:26.660
You can come to my place now.

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:28.640
What is your name?

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:30.920
A-Ayazuki Mei.

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:34.680
Why don't you look more bothered by this?

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:39.420
Ozaki-san, unfortunately she already 
has a prior engagement with me.

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:41.680
She was with me first, you know.

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:45.170
My, you're very popular, Mei. In that case...

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:47.070
You're welcome to come by at night.

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:51.580
I will polish up my body just for you.

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:53.840
Sensei! What about your next deadline?!

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:55.590
Don't mention my deadlines!

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:02.450
Help me!

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:06.000
Kyoka-san, it's only chasing after 
you because you're running away.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.430
Oh, Mei-san!

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:14.900
See you later, Mei!

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:17.950
Make sure to put my
 manuscript in the mail, Izumi.

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:21.040
Kyoka-san, stop running!

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:23.540
Like hell I'm going to stop!

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:25.710
And a nincompoopie poop...

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:28.220
Hey there, Kyoka-chan.

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:30.730
Ow!

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:33.880
Don't get your germs all over me!

00:07:33.880 --> 00:07:35.720
And don't call me "Kyoka-chan"!

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:38.720
Is that really what you're supposed 
to say after crashing into someone?

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:41.220
But the dog, the dog!

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:43.730
You mean <i>that</i> dog?

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:46.720
There, there. I'm so sorry.
I bet that hurt, didn't it?

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:49.550
But he didn't mean any harm, 
so please forgive him.

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:54.840
Even a savage dog is putty 
in Mei-san's hands.

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:55.980
Savage dog...

00:07:57.760 --> 00:08:00.430
Hey, Mei. Long time no see.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:04.860
Otoyakko-sa—I mean, Otojiro-san!

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:07.130
Thank you for all of your help the other day.

00:08:07.390 --> 00:08:09.530
You made quite the impression.

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:11.500
You're welcome to come by 
the geisha house any time.

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:15.270
Thank you very much. But I 
won't be going there anymore.

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:17.940
I would make Ougai-san worry.

00:08:17.940 --> 00:08:20.430
I see. Well, probably for the best, then.

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:24.020
I was on my way to grab something to eat. 
Do you want to come with me?

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.270
Stop.

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:30.190
She already has a previous engagement 
with me to go to a café, Kawakami-san.

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:33.770
Okay, but she was helping me 
find the black cat before that.

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:37.810
Oh? Then I'll just eat there instead.

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:39.530
Right, Kyoka-chan?

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:41.620
Wha? Why are you dragging me into this?

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:43.510
And don't call me Kyoka-chan!

00:08:43.510 --> 00:08:45.290
Nevermind the details.

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:47.430
There must be a reason
we all ran into each other.

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:48.790
Right, Mei?

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:52.540
Yes, eating together would make 
everything taste that much better.

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:04.340
Not bad.

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:09.060
I know. Just wait a bit longer.

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:24.750
It was bad enough that you
illegally trespassed on my property.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:26.950
What were you thinking 
peeping in as well?

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:29.770
W-We're sorry.

00:09:29.770 --> 00:09:32.720
We had no idea that the café 
was going to be your house.

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:34.330
What are you talking about?

00:09:34.950 --> 00:09:38.150
Welcome to Café Fujita!

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:39.590
Koizumi, you bastard.

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:43.650
It's all your fault for suddenly saying 
something smelled good and taking off.

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:47.400
B-But something really did smell good.

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:50.350
You give in to your appetite way too easily.

00:09:50.950 --> 00:09:54.980
Well, at any rate, we're here now. 
So you might as well serve some tea.

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:57.980
Do you want me to throw you 
in jail again, Kawakami?

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:05.490
Oh, a cat! Is it yours?

00:10:05.900 --> 00:10:07.260
It is not.

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:08.990
B-But...

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:11.620
It really likes you.

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:15.460
See, I told you.

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:19.250
Café Fujita is a cat residence 
where cats like to gather.

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:23.340
The black cat you're looking for
is sure to come by here.

00:10:24.340 --> 00:10:27.010
That might be true, Syunso-san!

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:30.510
If you say so, I guess.

00:10:30.820 --> 00:10:32.610
Looking for a black cat?

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:37.030
Would that be the black cat
that escaped from Hishida's painting?

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:40.020
That's right,

00:10:40.020 --> 00:10:44.280
but please don't slay Syunso-san's cat. We can get it back in the painting.

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:47.460
Can you honestly say that ghost 
cat won't do anything harmful?

00:10:47.460 --> 00:10:51.970
I can't, but if anything like that does 
happen, I'll take responsibility and stop it.

00:10:57.470 --> 00:11:00.360
Which reminds me... You're a Tamayori, right?

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:02.290
I heard about it from Kyoka-chan.

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:03.970
Right, Kyoka-chan?

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:06.090
Hey, where'd he go?

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:10.060
Wow, amazing!

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:12.260
There's not a single speck 
of dust in this house!

00:11:12.260 --> 00:11:15.840
This is the first time I've been to a private 
household where the sanitary condition is so good!

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:16.610
Hey...

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:20.790
That's high praise coming from Kyoka-chan.

00:11:20.790 --> 00:11:22.760
He may not seem like it, but Fujita-san

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:25.790
is very good at cooking, washing, 
and all household chores.

00:11:25.790 --> 00:11:28.570
That's incredible! You have my respect.

00:11:28.570 --> 00:11:30.370
You can't judge a book by its cover.

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:31.500
Leave.

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:34.760
No way. I'm staying here for now.

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:38.070
Fujita-san, out of consideration 
for me, your best friend,

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:41.450
won't you please let us partake of 
Café Fujita's Goro Special today?

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:43.520
Goro Special? Don't be ridiculous.

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:46.230
Café Fujita's Goro Special?

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:50.330
Sounds delicious!

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:56.880
Do what you will.

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:03.290
Who told you to help
 with the cooking?

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:07.050
Give it a rest and relax that 
severely furrowed brow.

00:12:07.050 --> 00:12:11.930
We're doing something we're not used to as 
our way of apologizing for trespassing.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:16.330
It's because Mei-san is 
extremely fond of eating.

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:21.160
I might actually have a chance with her 
if I make her something delicious.

00:12:23.190 --> 00:12:26.950
Koizumi, cut the pickle into 
angled bite-size pieces!

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:28.820
Angled? Bite-size pieces?

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:33.310
Don't let the miso soup boil!

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:34.760
But the germs!

00:12:34.760 --> 00:12:36.180
There is no such thing!

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:39.660
Let's see, where would the alcohol be?

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:43.130
The alcohol is on the left 
side of that cupboard.

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:44.820
How do you know that?!

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:46.820
Oh, found it.

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:49.890
This is the really good stuff, 
too. Let's all drink together.

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:50.890
Why, you...!

00:12:51.340 --> 00:12:53.160
This one is Grilled Ribs,

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:56.720
and this one is Skirt Steak.

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:02.560
Don't do that, Pork Loin.

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:04.740
What have you been going on about?

00:13:04.740 --> 00:13:07.820
I'm giving each of them 
a name that's easy to remember.

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:10.290
Weren't you supposed to be 
looking for the black cat?

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:13.140
Well, I haven't been able 
to find a black one.

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:15.320
So it's not here either, then.

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:16.860
Please cheer up.

00:13:16.860 --> 00:13:21.600
There's a delicious smell coming from the 
kitchen that might lure it in eventually...

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:26.600
Hey, you two. So this is where you've been.

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:28.210
O-Ougai-san?

00:13:28.210 --> 00:13:29.620
What are you doing here?

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:32.130
I was heading to the Metropolitan 
Police Department on business

00:13:32.130 --> 00:13:35.800
when I heard that Inspector 
Fujita was off duty.

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:39.330
I thought you might've been lured 
in by the delicious smell.

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:41.010
He's not like you.

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:45.270
What's this? Even Mori-san is here.

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:47.710
Welcome, welcome. Please do come in.

00:13:47.710 --> 00:13:49.390
Don't go inviting more guests.

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:53.020
You're all here. Is there a party today?

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:57.180
It looks truly enjoyable.

00:13:57.180 --> 00:13:59.500
I will certainly take you up 
on the offer to join you.

00:14:04.770 --> 00:14:07.160
This simmered beef with ginger!

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:08.770
It's well-seasoned with Japanese pepper,

00:14:08.770 --> 00:14:10.870
and it's so delicious that the taste

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:15.780
just spreads across my tongue and 
almost brings tears to my eyes!

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:19.550
Of course it does. I simmered 
it for a whole day.

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:23.870
What a surprise. I never expected you 
to be such a domestic person.

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:28.300
The miso soup.

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:33.050
Yes! The soup stock is also 
flavorful and very good.

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:36.030
Kyoka-san?

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:39.730
I-I'm glad you like it so much.

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:41.950
Come on, Mei, drink some.

00:14:41.950 --> 00:14:44.070
No, I'm not so good with alcohol.

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.830
I will take that.

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:50.980
Mei-san, these are the pickles I cut.

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:52.570
Here, say ah.

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:54.850
I will take that.

00:14:56.650 --> 00:14:59.010
Mei is my fiancée.

00:14:59.010 --> 00:15:03.850
Please refrain from getting 
closer to her than necessary.

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:06.610
What is he saying, Mr. Bunny?

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:11.100
Rather childish of you to get jealous 
over her being offered alcohol.

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:15.380
Mori-san, I challenge you to 
a round of Tiger, Tiger, Tiger

00:15:15.380 --> 00:15:17.730
to see who gets the honor of 
feeding things to Mei-san.

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:20.970
I guess I will accept, then.

00:15:20.970 --> 00:15:22.470
Wha?

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:28.490
Tiger, tiger, tiger, tiger.

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:32.580
Tiger, tiger, tiger, tiger.

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:36.650
Tiger, tiger, tiger, tiger.

00:15:36.650 --> 00:15:39.750
Syunso-san, shall I pour 
you some more alcohol?

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:40.610
Sure.

00:15:43.390 --> 00:15:46.500
Tiger, tiger, tiger, tiger.

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:48.890
I've had enough of this.

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:50.890
Tiger, tiger, tiger, tiger.

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:05.240
Curse you, ghost.

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:07.930
You've possessed my sword, have you?

00:16:08.430 --> 00:16:12.320
Now that it has come to this, 
I will make full use of your power.

00:16:13.020 --> 00:16:18.690
I will slay those who do wrong without 
mercy, be they ghosts or humans.

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:21.200
Prepare yourself.

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:23.820
We shall fall into the 
darkest depths together.

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.200
Fujita-san!

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:31.030
Fujita-san?

00:16:32.110 --> 00:16:33.220
Girl...

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:35.610
I will help you with the dishes.

00:16:36.360 --> 00:16:37.590
No need.

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:41.090
At least let me help with 
cleaning up, please.

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:43.510
It's freezing.

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:51.290
Cooking is such hard work.

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:54.400
Did you find the black cat?

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:55.830
It wasn't here.

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:56.750
I see.

00:16:57.110 --> 00:16:59.180
That wasn't a lie.

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:00.620
I haven't said anything.

00:17:02.260 --> 00:17:06.750
Why does you saber reflect 
things that cannot be seen?

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:13.250
It was reforged from a sword I used to have.

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:18.500
One that was possessed by a ghost.

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:23.400
You have some threads loose.

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:24.390
Huh?

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:27.520
The cats were clawing at it earlier.

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:28.390
Come with me.

00:17:34.290 --> 00:17:37.520
Wow, you can even sew as well.

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:41.000
I had the wrong impression 
of you, Fujita-san.

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:47.030
I thought you were a rather scary person, 
but you're really more like, well...

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:48.660
What?

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:51.540
A mother.

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:55.440
What are you talking about?

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:59.430
T-Thank you very much.

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:00.680
Girl...

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:02.930
Join me.

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:03.930
Huh?

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:08.310
The Supernatural Division would make 
good use of your Tamayori powers.

00:18:08.840 --> 00:18:10.260
The Supernatural Division?

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:13.950
To make me eliminate ghosts?

00:18:14.430 --> 00:18:17.950
Stay by me, and I will protect you.

00:18:24.050 --> 00:18:28.220
I will not allow anyone else 
to be sacrificed to spirits.

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:33.520
Th-That hurts.

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:35.210
My apologies.

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:39.590
Has something happened?

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:46.870
I'm sorry, though. I won't 
join the Supernatural Division.

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:48.790
Because I slay spirits?

00:18:49.260 --> 00:18:53.850
Neither Jane-san nor Shirayuki-san 
were simply things to be feared.

00:18:54.220 --> 00:18:57.190
I believe that, like humans, 
ghosts can also be complicated

00:18:57.190 --> 00:19:01.850
in their own ways and are capable 
of having kind hearts.

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:09.360
That is why I would like to learn more
about them, and understand them.

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:19.600
You're Ayazuki Mei-san, right?

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:23.590
What is it?

00:19:27.260 --> 00:19:29.530
I just felt a bit dizzy.

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:32.160
Are you all right?

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:35.760
Yes, forgive me. I'm fine now.

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:37.840
Don't push yourself.

00:19:37.840 --> 00:19:38.770
I won't.

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:40.940
No!

00:19:40.940 --> 00:19:44.150
W-W-What are you doing?!

00:19:44.150 --> 00:19:47.420
You have shown your true 
colors, Fujita-san!

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:49.660
No, you dirty policeman!

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:51.660
Who are you calling "dirty"?

00:19:51.660 --> 00:19:56.150
What the hell? You bastard, Fujita!

00:19:56.150 --> 00:19:59.680
What are you doing to my precious Mei?

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:02.310
Now he's Otoyakko!

00:20:02.120 --> 00:20:06.340
My Little Squirrel is mine and mine alone.

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:03.900
Dirty, dirty!

00:20:03.900 --> 00:20:04.850
Shut up!

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:06.340
What a pathetic man.

00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:07.220
Why, you...!

00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:09.110
I will have to make sure everyone 
else knows that as well,

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:09.110
Who do you think you are? How dare 
you speak to a lady like that!

00:20:09.110 --> 00:20:11.270
You can't get away with that just 
because you're a policeman!

00:20:09.110 --> 00:20:11.930
since they keep doing regrettable 
things like offering her

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:13.060
It's nonsense for a man to 
treat a lady so badly.

00:20:11.930 --> 00:20:13.810
alcohol and trying to feed her.

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:14.490
How the heck is he a lady?!

00:20:14.490 --> 00:20:16.560
Ugh, I'm hungry.

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:19.000
Okay, we're going to drink 
some more. Come on, Mei.

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:20.580
He told Mei to come.

00:20:20.580 --> 00:20:21.930
He did indeed.

00:20:21.930 --> 00:20:25.690
Now, now, everyone please refrain from 
dragging my Little Squirrel around.

00:20:25.690 --> 00:20:27.750
Are you listening? Hey, you guys!

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:32.570
It's not a good idea to 
drink too much, everyone!

00:20:40.430 --> 00:20:43.820
Huh? An eel? Okay.

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:53.300
And wit dat de eel ish done.

00:20:53.300 --> 00:20:56.270
Hey, dats not an eel!

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:58.230
Itsh totally an eel.

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:01.920
Such a shplendid eel. It's great!

00:20:58.480 --> 00:21:00.200
Do it over.

00:21:02.470 --> 00:21:04.380
I wanna eat shome eel!

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:06.780
Haven't you had enough to eat?

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:08.930
I wanna eat tofu!

00:21:08.930 --> 00:21:09.870
Huh?

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:11.810
Tofu looksh like dis.

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:12.910
How about a drink, Inspector Fujita?

00:21:12.240 --> 00:21:15.040
Hey, it's tofu! Looks shoo good.

00:21:13.350 --> 00:21:14.150
Sure.

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:18.090
Now then,

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:23.880
Army Surgeon First Class Mori, 
what did you come here for?

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:28.380
I wondered if a member of the
 Supernatural Division, such as yourself,

00:21:28.380 --> 00:21:32.310
might be able to protect that incredibly 
important girl in ways that I cannot.

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:33.340
What?

00:21:35.490 --> 00:21:36.630
I can't do that.

00:21:36.630 --> 00:21:37.770
Why not?

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:39.480
She already turned me down.

00:21:39.920 --> 00:21:41.280
Well, then.

00:21:41.960 --> 00:21:43.610
She's a strange girl.

00:21:43.890 --> 00:21:46.560
There is no other girl as good as her.

00:21:54.560 --> 00:21:56.640
They are a boisterous bunch,

00:21:57.320 --> 00:22:02.900
but this evening wasn't so bad.

00:22:08.280 --> 00:22:10.190
It's all thanks to her.

00:22:12.570 --> 00:22:16.300
Okay, everyone, I've brought refills.

00:22:16.300 --> 00:22:18.460
Oh, how thoughtful of you.

00:22:18.460 --> 00:22:20.460
Thank you very much, Mei-san!

00:22:20.460 --> 00:22:22.510
Yuck, what is this?

00:22:20.950 --> 00:22:21.980
<i>Mei...</i>

00:22:22.510 --> 00:22:24.560
So this ain't alcohol?

00:22:24.560 --> 00:22:29.430
Nope. You've all had far too much to 
drink, so I brought you some water.

00:22:29.430 --> 00:22:30.740
No way! Come on!

00:22:30.740 --> 00:22:32.900
Stop playing! More alcohol!

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>Meiji Tokyo Renka</b>

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:40.010
Next Episode Preview

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:40.010
Labyrinth of Love
and Heartache

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:33.730
Mei, why do you gaze 
at the moon?

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:39.030
Will you soon be
 leaving my side?
